& [ImplementedCorrespondence]
  + request validation binds exact catalogue fabric lexical-index tokenizer terms and finite budgets
  + whole Slice4B1 sidecar validation and canonical replay precede every posting read
  + ordered original terms retain token occurrence accounts while unique eligible tokens determine coverage
  + the complete posting union and complete match set are counted before success so overflow cannot masquerade as low ambiguity
  + every match retains complete SemanticAddress and matched token surface digest occurrence and source evidence
  + deterministic coverage-descending address order retains equal matches without selecting a winner
  + result proof identity and whole-result replay reject self-consistent mutation
  + fixed non-authority text prevents lexical correspondence from being reported as truth permission purpose safety or authority

